'''Kitarou''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and can be obtained during the [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 453
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kitarou
|name2 = GeGeGe no Kitarou
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''GeGeGe no Kitarou''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kitatou can help for the [[Zombie Outbreaks]] in [[Empire of Cats]], as he's capable of killing the Zombies quickly. However, because of his pathetic stats and very long recharge time, he will be of no use anywhere else.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger & User Rank Dump}}

